@startuml

salt
{
  <b>ORE STUDIO - REPORTING: CHANGE HOW A PRODUCT IS PRICED</b>
  <b>Propose a change to BermudanSwaption</b>
  --
  Nothing changes now. Version 4 stays in force until the sign-off completes.
  After that the change reaches the next run of each of the 4 reports that bind it.
  { Model | ^BlackBachelier^ }
  { Engine | ^BlackBachelierSwaptionEngine^ }
  {#
    Parameter | Before | After | State
    Calibration | Bootstrap | - | will be dropped
    ShiftHorizon | 0.5 | - | will be dropped
    sx | 3.0 | - | will be dropped
  }
  {
    What to do with the change
    (X) Propose a new version of End of day pricing
    ( ) Try it in a draft copy
  }
  Version 5 waits for Quant team, Market risk and Model validation. The proposer cannot sign off.
  { Change reason | ^Rectification^ }
  { Commentary | "Desk moved to the Bachelier model" }
  [ Cancel ] | [ Submit for sign-off ]
  --
  A draft changes in place, with no sign-off, and reaches no run.
}

@enduml
